Z||000003||fropuff||03-09-2001||05:30 PM||||Yeah, I also think driving it will let it reset.  There was a Chev 454 SS at a dealer, and the speedo was at 10 when it was shut off.  A guy bought it and brought it back for service; the speedo now read 0 when parked.  Give it a try.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who are worried about being caught.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Will||03-09-2001||05:34 PM||||Do a little taking apart so that you can get your finger between the clear plastic cover and the guage face, then flip the needle back over to the correct side with either your finger or the tip of a screw driver.<P>Exceeding 80 mph might work too...||||reg||1
